Student Management System in C

Project Description

This project is a simple Student Management System developed using the C programming language and Docker.

Features

- Add Student
- Display Students
- Search Student
- Exit the Application

Technologies Used

- C Programming
- Docker
- Docker Hub
- AWS EC2 Ubuntu

Build Docker Image

docker build -t studentapp .

Run the Application

docker run -it --rm studentapp

Docker Hub

Docker image: "abinayalakshmanan/studentapp:latest"
